# RECONSTRUCTED, not upstream text.  Everything else in this file is verbatim.
#
# Before 2021-06-17 (1fdd48b832) upstream kept ONE current-state roster that was
# overwritten each release instead of accumulating versioned blocks.  When the
# block structure was retrofitted it reached back only as far as 0.8, so the
# people below were dropped from the file entirely -- they appear in no 0.8
# through 0.I block.  Recovered from data/credits at 9f852e59e9 (2013-08-26),
# the richest surviving pre-block roster; groupings and spellings are upstream's.
#
# Excluded as the same person under an older handle: OzoneH3, credited as Ozone
# in the 0.8 block, and illi-kun, credited as Ill-kun in 0.A.

